                                                "sense_id": "8ff4e720-330d-306f-9b9a-17af7170eb82",
                                                "text": "In an inner mountain land where none hath come he hath carved his organ pipes out of the mountains, and there when the winds, his servants, come in from all the world he maketh the melody of Limpang-Tung."
